  _recollection: {fileID: 0}
  _lines:
  - 'I''m at school. '
  - It's dark and rainy and I'm late for class.
  - 'I''d been to the school before, of course. I go everyday. '
  - But I couldn't find the classroom.
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - I pull up my phone to look at a map.
  - I ask a passerby for some help.
  - I keep walking the way I think I'm meant to go.
